{
  "title": "A Proven dua",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Anas is reported to have quoted the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) as saying: Whoever says this supplicatory prayer every morning and every evening, Allah the All-exalted will order four angels to defend him from the front side, the backside, the right side, and the left side, he will be kept under the security of Allah the Almighty and All-majestic, and no harm can ever affect him even if all jinn and all human beings try to cause him harm:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEME \nIn the name of Allah, the All-Beneficent, the All-Merciful.\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ خَيْرِ الْاَسْمَاۤءِ \nBISMIL LAAHE KHAYRIL ASMAAA-E \nIn the name of Allah, the best of names. \nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ رَبِّ الْاَرْضِ وَ السَّمَاۤءِ \nBISMIL LAAHE RABBIL ARZE WAS SAMAAA-E \nIn the name of Allah, Lord of the earth and the heaven. \nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الَّذِىْ لَايَضُرُّ مَعَ اسْمِهِ سَمٌّ وَلَا دَاۤءٌ \nBISMIL LAAHIL LAZEE LAA YAZURRO MA-A’SMEHI SAMMUN WA LAA DAAA-UN \nIn the name of Allah, with Whose name no poison or disease can cause harm. \nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ اَصْبَحْتُ وَ عَلَى اللّٰهِ تَوَكَّلْتُ \nBISMIL LAAHE ASBAHTO WA A’LAL LAAHE TAWAKKALTO \nIn the name of Allah, I have entered the morning, and in Allah I have placed my trust.\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ عَلٰى قَلْبِىْ وَ نَفْسِىْ \nBISMIL LAAHE A’LAA QALBEE WA NAFSEE \nIn the name of Allah upon my heart and my soul. \nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ عَلٰى دِيْنِىْ وَ عَقْلِىْ \nBISMIL LAAHE A’LAA DEENEE WA A’QLEE \nIn the name of Allah upon my religion and my intellect. \nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ عَلٰۤى اَهْلِىْ وَ مَالِىْ \nBISMIL LAAHE A’LAAA AHLEE WA MAALEE \nIn the name of Allah upon my family and my wealth. \nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ عَلٰى مَاۤ اَعْطَانِىْ رَبِّىْ \nBISMIL LAAHE A’LAA MAAA AA’TAANEE RABBEE \nIn the name of Allah upon what my Lord has granted me. \nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الَّذِىْ لَايَضُرُّ مَعَ اسْمِهٖ شَىْءٌ فِى الْاَرْضِ \nBISMIL LAAHIL LAZEE LAA YAZURRO MA-A’SMEHI SHAY-UN FIL ARZE \nIn the name of Allah, with Whose name nothing in the earth \nوَ لَا فِىْ السَّمَاۤءِ وَ هُوَ السَّمِيْعُ الْعَلِيْمُ \nWA LAA FIS SAMAAA-E WA HOWAS SAMEE-U’L A’LEEMO \nor in the heaven can cause harm, and He is the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing.\nاَللهُ اَللهُ رَبِّىْ لَاۤ اُشْرِكُ بِهٖ شَيْئًا \nALLAAHO ALLAAHO RABBEE LAA OSHREKO BEHE SHAY-AN \nAllah, Allah is my Lord; I do not associate anything with Him. \nاَللهُ اَكْبَرُ اَللهُ اَكْبَرُ وَ اَعَزُّ وَ اَجَلُّ مِمَّاۤ اَخَافُ وَ اَحْذَرُ \nALLAAHO AKBARO ALLAAHO AKBARO WA A-A’ZZO WA AJALLO MIMMAAA AKHAAFO WA AHAZARO \nAllah is the Greatest, Allah is the Greatest, and more Mighty and more Majestic than what I fear and guard against. \nعَزَّ جَارُكَ وَ جَلَّ ثَنَاۤؤُكَ وَلَاۤ اِلٰهَ غَيْرُكَ \nA’ZZA JAAROKA WA JALLA SANAAA-OKA WALAA ELAAHA GHAYROKA \nYour protection is powerful, Your praise is exalted, and there is no god other than You.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْۤ اَعُوْذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّ نَفْسِىْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNEEE A-O’OZO BEKA MIN SHARRE NAFSEE \nO Allah, I seek refuge in You from the evil of my soul, \nوَ مِنْ شَرِّ كُلِّ سُلْطَانٍ شَدِيْدٍ \nWA MIN SHARRE KOLLE SOLTAANEN SHADEEDIN \nfrom the evil of every powerful tyrant, \nوَ مِنْ شَرِّ كُلِّ شَيْطَانٍ مَرِيْدٍ \nWA MIN SHARRE KOLLE SHAYTAANEN MAREEDEN \nfrom the evil of every rebellious devil, \nوَ مِنْ شَرِّ كُلِّ جَبَّارٍ عَنِيْدٍ \nWA MIN SHARRE KOLLE JABBAAREN A’NEEDEN \nfrom the evil of every stubborn oppressor, \nوَ مِنْ شَرِّ قَضَاۤءِ السُّوْۤءِ وَ مِنْ كُلِّ دَآبَّةٍ اَنْتَ اٰخِذٌ بِنَاصِيَتِهَاۤ \nWA MIN SHARRE QAZAAA-ES SOOO-E WA MIN KOLLE DAABBATEN ANTA AAKHEZON BENAASEYATEHAAA \nand from the evil of an ill fate, and from every creature whose forelock You hold. \nاِنَّكَ عَلٰى صِرَاطٍ مُّسْتَقِيْمٍ \nINNAKA A’LAA SERAATEM MOSTAQEEMIN \nIndeed, You are upon a straight path, \nوَ اَنْتَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَىْءٍ حَفِيْظٌ \nWA ANTA A’LAA KOLLE SHAY-EN HAFEEZON \nand You are a Guardian over all things.\nاِنَّ وَلِيِّىَ اللّٰهُ الَّذِىْ نَزَّلَ الْكِتَابَ \nINNA WALIYYEYAL LAAHUL LAZEE NAZZALAL KETAABA \nIndeed, my protector is Allah, Who sent down the Book, \nوَ هُوَ يَتَوَلَّى الصَّالِحِيْنَ \nWA HOWA YATAWALLAS SAALEHEENA \nand He befriends the righteous. \nفَاِنْ تَوَلَّوْا فَقُلْ حَسْبِىَ اللّٰهُ \nFA-IN TAWALLAW FAQOL HASBEYALLAAHO \nBut if they turn away, then say: \"Allah is sufficient for me; \nلَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا هُوَ عَلَيْهِ تَوَكَّلْتُ \nLAA ELAAHA ELLAA HOWA A’LAYHE TAWAKKALTO \nthere is no god but Him. In Him I have placed my trust, \nوَ هُوَ رَبُّ الْعَرْشِ الْعَظِيْمِ.\nWA HOWA RABBOL A’RSHEL A’ZEEME.\nand He is the Lord of the Great Throne.\""
}
